---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy: Book and Gin Society"
  description="How the Book and Gin Society handles the personal information collected on this site."
>
  <section class="page-head"><h1>Privacy</h1></section>
  <article class="prose">
    <p>This site is run by the Book and Gin Society, a book club in Wellington, New Zealand.</p>

    <h2>What we collect and why</h2>
    <p>If you sign up for The Minutes, we collect your email address so we can send it to you. If you write to us, we keep your message and email address so we can reply.</p>

    <h2>Email tracking</h2>
    <p>Our email service, MailerLite, records whether each email is opened and which links are clicked. This is linked to your subscriber record. We use it to understand what's worth sending.</p>

    <h2>Website statistics</h2>
    <p>We use Vercel Web Analytics to count visits to this site. It doesn't use cookies or identify you personally.</p>

    <h2>Who else handles your information</h2>
    <p>We don't sell or share your information. Your email address is stored by MailerLite, and this site is hosted by Vercel. Both may store data outside New Zealand.</p>

    <h2>Unsubscribing</h2>
    <p>Every email from us has an unsubscribe link. Use it at any time and we'll stop sending you The Minutes.</p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the Privacy Act 2020, you can ask for a copy of the personal information we hold about you and ask for it to be corrected. Write to us at <a href="mailto:hello@bookandginsociety.com">hello@bookandginsociety.com</a>.</p>
  </article>
</Base>
